  "initial_failure": "The first transform codec test used an arrow crate import unavailable to sail-execution. Corrected to datafusion::arrow; original failed candidate and logs retained.",
  "scope": "Exact detached Rust library gates. Public CLI/runtime qualification is recorded separately.",
  "limitations": [
    "No integrated ORC source or sink qualification from these units.",
    "SQL type/literal lowering, TIME-specific string parsing and configuration enforcement remain incomplete.",
    "Nested container literal conversion does not yet use the enclosing declared type to supply child literal types.",
    "Generic DataFusion scalar physical-expression decoding loses top-level return-field metadata. The activated precision helper handles containers, whose nested field metadata survives and is executed in the codec test.",
    "Streaming/Iggy and CDC runtime remain unimplemented; the canonical SDP assertion inventory is unchanged."
  ],
